    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add shells and cook, stirring occasionally, until tender yet firm to the bite, about 9 minutes. Drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yhYieBuTGHlUA6_txe0Bwz5wQ_Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-50896-Creamy-Crab-and-Pasta-Salad-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-02-ee1d500ea15b45b4bb221c6f010b80b1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/50896/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix sour cream, mayonnaise, lemon juice, honey mustard, dill, salt, and pepper together in a bowl until creamy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JE3fYJjt0a9YXOznt1uvCNoE01w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-50896-Creamy-Crab-and-Pasta-Salad-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-03-24cff9c617a344aca7188b6ca3d67906.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/50896/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer cooked pasta to a large bowl. Add sour cream mixture, crabmeat, bell peppers, and green onions.",
